      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so my son is 38lbs and has a fever. i found a dosing calculator online and it says for his weight and the 160mg/5ml concentration he needs 7.5ml of tylenol. i just want to make sure i'm not crazy before i give it to him since its late and i can't reach the doctor. does 7.5ml sound right for a kid that size?",
